    {
      "path": "scripts/scene_host_proxy.py",
      "content": "BUG（低概率可复现）：`state.update` 重建顶层字段时丢弃了既有台账里的 `resource_lease_token`（及 `accepted_at`）。FINALIZING_FAILURE 总是在 `_release_resource` 之前落盘：若进程在两者之间死亡，重启后 `_resume_finalization` 取 `state.get(\"resource_lease_token\")` 为 None，SCENE_EXEC_HOST 资源租约无法主动释放，只能等 Backend TTL 过期回收。最小修复：写 finalization 时保留资源租约身份。",
      "suggestion_code": "def _save_finalization(cfg, run_id, attempt, lease_token, *, stage, work_root=None, **facts):\n    state = _read_json(state_path(cfg, run_id)) or {}\n    state.update({\"version\": \"scene-proxy-recovery-v1\", \"pipeline_run_id\": run_id,\n                  \"attempt\": attempt, \"lease_token\": lease_token,\n                  \"resource_lease_token\": state.get(\"resource_lease_token\"),\n                  \"accepted_at\": state.get(\"accepted_at\"),\n                  \"stage\": stage, \"identity\": _process_identity(), \"updated_at\": time.time(),\n                  \"finalization\": {\"work_root\": str(work_root) if work_root else None, **facts}})",
